<Base
  title="Sources"
  description="The open data behind House Sums: every dataset with its publisher, licence and last refresh date."
>
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Sources</h1>
    <p>
      This page will list every dataset the calculator uses, with its publisher, its licence and the
      month it was last refreshed.
    </p>
    <p>
      The local figures will come from open government data: the UK House Price Index from HM Land
      Registry, private rents from the Office for National Statistics and quoted mortgage rates from
      the Bank of England.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
